{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54680","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两日鬬，少时（京本作「小将」）及明朝。\n倘或必（辛本、川本、京本作「忽」）闻如此兆，外藩草莽竞（京本作「尽」）兴妖，进步即嚎啕（辛本、川本作「疾兵消」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}